---
description: >-
  A simple three-step linear flow (Browse -> Checkout -> Download receipt)
  rendered with `direction BT` (bottom to top). Companion to
  18-direction-right-to-left.mmd.
---
usecase-beta
    direction BT

    actor Customer
    Browse("Browse catalog")
    Checkout("Checkout")
    Receipt[Download receipt]

    Customer --> Browse
    Browse --> Checkout
    Checkout --> Receipt
